# Logging and Diagnostics

- Use the project's logging API (e.g. OSLog, custom logger) instead of `print` for diagnostics.
- Log at an appropriate level (e.g. debug for development, error for failures); avoid logging PII or secrets.
- Prefer structured or clearly formatted messages so logs are searchable and actionable.
